[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 11180.95, "timestamp": "03:06:20", "text": "我的天啊。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11186.71, "timestamp": "03:06:26", "text": "猪。谁给我发的好友请求？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11188.55, "timestamp": "03:06:28", "text": "兄弟？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11191.99, "timestamp": "03:06:31", "text": "呃，有副总裁说这是单人表演。是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11193.199, "timestamp": "03:06:33", "text": "是的。 哦，那是我们的独奏。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11195.6, "timestamp": "03:06:35", "text": "哦，那是我们的独奏。 你接受来自谁的好友请求吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11197.279, "timestamp": "03:06:37", "text": "你接受来自谁的好友请求吗？ 随机用户？不，我有大约50个朋友"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11200.72, "timestamp": "03:06:40", "text": "随机用户？不，我有大约50个朋友 现在就提出请求。我的天啊。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11208.63, "timestamp": "03:06:48", "text": "那是因为，呃，当我以前玩的时候"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11211.349, "timestamp": "03:06:51", "text": "就像认真地说，呃，会有这样的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11213.99, "timestamp": "03:06:53", "text": "好多人喜欢加我好友"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11216.07, "timestamp": "03:06:56", "text": "玩家和虚幻引擎，他们就像，“哦，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11218.55, "timestamp": "03:06:58", "text": "请用小号带我进去。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11219.83, "timestamp": "03:06:59", "text": "秩。”"}]